      "content": "no she's not dead lol. i cut contact. went no contact tonight after she said some things that... i don't know. it doesn't even matter what she said, i've heard it all before\n\nthe thing is my therapist has been telling me for years that my family is \"toxic\" and i should set boundaries. but my therapist only hears my side. what if i really was just... difficult to love? like genuinely. what if the common denominator in all of it is me",
